{"id":"canard","lemma":"canard","pos":"noun","rank":2731,"glosses":["duck (of either sex)","drake (male duck)","canard, hoax"],"ipa":"/ka.naʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c3/Fr-canard.ogg/Fr-canard.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"canards","feminine":"cane"},"formAudio":{"canards":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-canards.wav","cane":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-cane.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je vais aller nourrir les canards.","en":"I'm going to go feed the ducks.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to feed , nourish"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Cela ressemble à un canard.","en":"It looks like a duck.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to resemble","l":"ressembler"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Il fait un froid de canard.","en":"It's bitterly cold.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"cold"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Où est le canard en caoutchouc ?","en":"Where is the rubber duck?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"rubber"}]},{"text":"Ne nourrissez pas les canards.","en":"Don't feed the ducks.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to feed , nourish","l":"nourrir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]}]}